# Vulnerabilities compiled into the upstream FrankenPHP base image
# (dunglas/frankenphp:1-php8.4) — its embedded Go toolchain + Go deps.
# NOT fixable from our Dockerfile (they live in the compiled `frankenphp`
# binary, not in an apt/composer/npm package). They sit in FrankenPHP's
# gRPC/x/text/stdlib code paths, which this app does not expose as a gRPC
# server, so real-world exposure is low. Re-check and REMOVE each entry once
# a FrankenPHP base image ships the fixed versions (Go >= 1.26.5,
# golang.org/x/text >= 0.39.0, google.golang.org/grpc >= 1.82.1).
CVE-2026-56852
CVE-2026-39822
GHSA-hrxh-6v49-42gf
GHSA-r277-6w6q-xmqw
